[COMMAND]:      install.set.pemkey
[PACKAGE]:      INSTALL
[USE]:          dock -install set.pemkey

[OUT]:          Set the correct permissions to the PEM key on the local computer.

[ACTIONS]:      chmod 600 /mnt/Dock/Scripts/Keys/docker.pem
                chmod 600 /mnt/Dock/Scripts/Keys/docker.pem.pub

[NOTES]:        N/A
